    "featureId": "starstone:cable_item",
    "id": "starstone:cable_item/use",
    "text": "Place it on the floor, a wall or the ceiling: any face of a full block. Cables next to each other on the same surface join up on their own, and a line carries on over the outside edge of a block. For an inside corner use a Starstone Inner Corner; to go through a block use a Starstone Conduit. If the block behind a cable is removed, the cable drops."
  },
