    "id": "starstone:inner_corner_item/use",
    "text": "Place it in the empty space where two surfaces meet at a right angle, such as a floor and a wall, or two walls. It joins the cable lines on both surfaces, so a line can turn from the floor up a wall. It drops when fewer than two of the surfaces behind it remain."
