    "featureId": "starstone:conduit",
    "id": "starstone:conduit/use",
    "text": "A solid block that carries power straight through, so a line can pass through a wall, floor or ceiling. It runs straight out from the face you click when you place it, and only its two ends connect: mount a part on an end, or run a cable into it. Its sides never connect. To change its direction, break it and place it again."
  },
