    "featureId": "starstone:generator",
    "id": "starstone:generator/use",
    "text": "A power source that needs no fuel. A new generator starts switched on; use it to switch it off and on. Cables and parts touching any of its six faces connect to it, and so do parts around its outside edges, such as a cable on the side of the block it stands on. While it is on, its whole network has power."
  },
