    "featureId": "starstone:lamp",
    "id": "starstone:lamp/use",
    "text": "A thin light panel. Mount it on any face of a block and connect it to Starstone power; it shines at light level {{starstone:lamp/powered-light}} while powered. Quickest test: place it straight on a Starstone Generator."
