    "id": "starstone:ore/use",
    "text": "Mine it with an iron, diamond or netherite pickaxe for Starstone Dust; Fortune gives more. Silk Touch keeps the ore block, which you can smelt into dust later. It glows faintly, which helps you spot it underground."
