    "featureId": "starstone:redstone_input",
    "id": "starstone:redstone_input/use",
    "text": "Turns redstone into Starstone power. Mount it on a block, then power that block (a lever or button on it, or a repeater leading into it), or put redstone dust or a redstone device right next to the input. Any signal switches the network on, even strength 1; the strength itself is not passed on."
  },
