    "featureId": "starstone:network",
    "id": "starstone:network/extending",
    "text": "To reach further, place Starstone Cable on the generator or on the ground right next to it and lay a line to a lamp. Parts join when they sit side by side on the same surface or meet around the outside edge of a block, such as a lamp on top of a block and a cable on its side. For an inside corner, use a Starstone Inner Corner."
  },
