    "featureId": "starstone:network",
    "id": "starstone:network/check-connections",
    "text": "If a lamp stays dark, first check that a generator is on or a Starstone Redstone Input is getting a redstone signal. Then follow the line from the source: each part needs the block behind it and must meet the next part on the same surface, around an outside edge or through a Starstone Inner Corner. A Starstone Conduit connects only at its two ends, not its sides: run the cable into an end, or break the conduit and place it again from the right face. A Starstone Bridge keeps its two lines apart, so follow the powered line straight across."
  },
