    "id": "starstone:network/recovery",
    "text": "If you built or changed wiring with commands or structure blocks and part of it is not recognised, it usually catches up on its own. To fix it at once, stand near it and run /scriptevent starstone:rebuild_nearby. When you return to an area, its parts catch up a moment after it loads."
